{"strongs": "H5116", "word": "נָוֶה", "translit": "na.veh", "root": "נוה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "abode of shepherd, or flocks", "definition": "I. נָוֶה noun masculine Isa 27:10 abode of shepherd, or flocks , in poetry habitation ; — absolute Isa 27:10 +; construct נְוֵה Exod 15:13 +; נְוַת Job 8:6 (as if from נָוָה ; or read נְוֵה ?); suffix נָָֽוְךָ Job 5:24 , נָוֵ֫הוּ 2Sam 15:25 +, נְוֵהֶם Jer 49:20 ; Ezek 34:14 (compare Sta § 351 c .), נְוֵהֶן Jer 23:3 (so Baer Ginsb ; נְוֵיהֶן van d. H. , plural according to Kö ii, 1, p. 77 ); — 1. a. adode , of sheep 2Sam 7:8 (|| מֵאַחַר הַצּאֹן ) = 1Chr 17:1 ; Isa 65:10 (|| רָבַץ ); of people under figure of sheep Jer 23:3 ; Jer 49:20 = Jer 50:45 ; Jer 50:19 ; Ezek 34:14 (twice in verse) (|| רָבַץ , מִרְעֶה ); of camels Ezek 25:5 (|| מִרְבַּץ צאֹן ). \\ \\ b. adode of shepherds Jer 33:12 (+ מַרְבִּיצִים צאֹן ). \\ \\ c. = meadow , in figure of Ephraim planted ( שָׁתוּל ) as tree Hos 9:13 . 2. habitation , usually of country, or of domains in the country (chiefly in poetry), Job 5:3 ; Job 8:6 ( נְוַת צִדְקֶ֑ךָ , see above), Prov 21:20 || אֹהֶל Job 5:24 ; Job 18:15 || בַּיִת Prov 3:33 || רֵבֶץ Prov 24:15 of ׳ י in Canaan 2Sam 15:25 of Can. as place of ׳ י 's sanctuary, קָדְשֶׁ֑ךָ ׳ נ Exod 15:13 figurative of ׳ י himself, צֶדֶק ׳ נ Jer 50:7 habit. of nation Jer 10:25 ; Jer 25:30 ; Isa 32:18 ( שָׁלוֺם ׳ נ ), Ps 79:7 = city Isa 27:10 , especially Jerusalem Isa 33:20 ( שַׁאֲנָן ׳ נ , || אֹהֶל ); אֵיתָן ׳ נ Jer 49:19 (figurative of Edom) = Jer 50:44 (of Babylonian ); of land of Israel, צֶדֶק ׳ נ Jer 31:23 (|| הַר הַקֹּדֶשׁ ). Twice of habitation of jackals Isa 34:13 ; Isa 35:7 (both || חָצִיר ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5044')\">BDB5044</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5116')\">H5116</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5043')\">BDB5043</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5045')\">BDB5045</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>נָוֶה</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 27:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,10)\">Isa 27:10</ref></sup> <highlightword>abode of shepherd, or flocks</highlightword>, in poetry <highlightword>habitation</highlightword>; — absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 27:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,10)\">Isa 27:10</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>נְוֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,13)\">Exod 15:13</ref> +; <bdbheb>נְוַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 8:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,6)\">Job 8:6</ref> (as if from <bdbheb>נָוָה</bdbheb>; or read <bdbheb>נְוֵה</bdbheb> ?); suffix <bdbheb>נָָֽוְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,24)\">Job 5:24</ref>, <bdbheb>נָוֵ֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:25\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,25)\">2Sam 15:25</ref> +, <bdbheb>נְוֵהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 49:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,20)\">Jer 49:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,14)\">Ezek 34:14</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>§ 351 c</sup></lookup>.), <bdbheb>נְוֵהֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,3)\">Jer 23:3</ref> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb</lookup>; <bdbheb>נְוֵיהֶן</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup>, plural according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii, 1, p. 77</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>adode</highlight>, of sheep <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,8)\">2Sam 7:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מֵאַחַר הַצּאֹן</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,1)\">1Chr 17:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 65:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,10)\">Isa 65:10</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רָבַץ</bdbheb>); of people under figure of sheep <ref ref=\"Jer 23:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,3)\">Jer 23:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,20)\">Jer 49:20</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 50:45\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,45)\">Jer 50:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,19)\">Jer 50:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,14)\">Ezek 34:14</ref> (twice in verse) (|| <bdbheb>רָבַץ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִרְעֶה</bdbheb>); of camels <ref ref=\"Ezek 25:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,5)\">Ezek 25:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מִרְבַּץ צאֹן</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>adode of shepherds</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,12)\">Jer 33:12</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מַרְבִּיצִים צאֹן</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> = <highlight>meadow</highlight>, in figure of Ephraim planted (<bdbheb>שָׁתוּל</bdbheb>) as tree <ref ref=\"Hos 9:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,13)\">Hos 9:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>habitation</highlight>, usually of country, or of domains in the country (chiefly in poetry), <ref ref=\"Job 5:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,3)\">Job 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 8:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,6)\">Job 8:6</ref> (<bdbheb>נְוַת צִדְקֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb>, see above), <ref ref=\"Prov 21:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,20)\">Prov 21:20</ref> || <bdbheb>אֹהֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,24)\">Job 5:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 18:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,18,15)\">Job 18:15</ref> || <bdbheb>בַּיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,33)\">Prov 3:33</ref> || <bdbheb>רֵבֶץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 24:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,15)\">Prov 24:15</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> in Canaan <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:25\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,25)\">2Sam 15:25</ref> of Can. as place of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s sanctuary, <bdbheb>קָדְשֶׁ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,13)\">Exod 15:13</ref> figurative of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> himself, <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 50:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,7)\">Jer 50:7</ref> habit. of nation <ref ref=\"Jer 10:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,25)\">Jer 10:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 25:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,30)\">Jer 25:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 32:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,18)\">Isa 32:18</ref> (<bdbheb>שָׁלוֺם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 79:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,7)\">Ps 79:7</ref> = city <ref ref=\"Isa 27:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,10)\">Isa 27:10</ref>, especially Jerusalem <ref ref=\"Isa 33:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,20)\">Isa 33:20</ref> (<bdbheb>שַׁאֲנָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>אֹהֶל</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>אֵיתָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 49:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,19)\">Jer 49:19</ref> (figurative of Edom) = <ref ref=\"Jer 50:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,44)\">Jer 50:44</ref> (of Babylonian ); of land of Israel, <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 31:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,23)\">Jer 31:23</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הַר הַקֹּדֶשׁ</bdbheb>). Twice of habitation of jackals <ref ref=\"Isa 34:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,13)\">Isa 34:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 35:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,7)\">Isa 35:7</ref> (both || <bdbheb>חָצִיר</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 27:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 27, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Exod 15:13", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Job 8:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 8, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Job 5:24", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 5, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:25", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Jer 49:20", "book": "JER", "chapter": 49, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Ezek 34:14", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 34, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 23:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 23, "verse": 3}